  "body": "Occupying an impressive 1,376sqm (more or less) site with access through to the water, this substantial property presents a rare opportunity to secure a premium landholding in one of the area's most sought-after waterfront settings.\r\n\r\nConstructed in solid brick/block over two levels, the existing residence offers generous proportions and a highly functional layout for family living. Upstairs, the kitchen, dining and living spaces flow seamlessly to an elevated deck overlooking the swimming pool and stunning water views. Filled with natural light, the home provides an outstanding foundation for those wishing to modernise and create a truly exceptional family residence.\r\n\r\nThe generous, level lawn offers an incredible space for children to play, family gatherings and outdoor entertaining, while also providing scope to add value in the future. \r\n\r\nThe lower level adds further versatility with two additional bedrooms, a family bathroom, spacious flexible use room and a living & bar area, offering flexibility for teenagers, extended family, guests or working from home. A lift enhances everyday living, offering effortless accessibility, exceptional convenience and peace of mind for years to come.\r\n\r\nSet in one of the Eastern Bays' most desirable locations, this property is moments from the Tamaki Estuary and the heart of Glendowie. Enjoy easy access to beautiful beaches, parks, sought-after schools and convenient public transport, all along the leafy surrounds of prestigious Riddell Road.\r\n\r\nOpportunities of this calibre are becoming increasingly scarce. With substantial land, private water access and endless potential in an exceptional setting, this is a property that will reward for years to come.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n* 1,376sqm (more or less) site with access through to the water\r\n* Exceptional opportunity to renovate, rebuild or create a bespoke residence (subject to council approval)\r\n* Substantial solid brick home with generous proportions across two levels\r\n* Four bedrooms, three bathrooms and multiple living areas\r\n* Large rumpus room, office and bar providing flexible family accommodation\r\n* North-facing swimming pool and expansive level lawn\r\n* Elevated entertaining deck enjoying peaceful water views\r\n* Zoned for Churchill Park School and Glendowie College",
